      "reconstructedIast": "ajñanaṭubhajñaheṭu | ina palite | naheṭu | gībo ajñatenaheṭu | śapumaheṭu | jñamupuheṭu | uśakhiṃmaheṭu | gībhumaheṭu | catulinaheṭu | bhulitenaheṭu | ahuhujñaheṭu | bhuliteheṭu | dhyānamulite | gībhumumuhu | bhoṭamumuhumulinubhubhuhu | sajñatubhubhuhu | cipuphabhubhuhu | aṅgīnubhubhubhuhu | pulite ibhubhuhu | svāhā ||"
